replace_once(path,"fireRailgun=function multiplicityRailgun(n,echoed=false){const target=nearestWeaponTarget('rail'),angle=target?Math.atan2(target.y-player.y,target.x-player.x):player.angle,x=player.x,y=player.y;baseFireRailgun(n,echoed);if(echoed||!target)return;const extra=multishotStacks(),length=weaponRange('rail'),size=weaponSizeMultiplier(),damage=(40+n*9.4)*.68,width=(5.2+n*.72)*size*.82,eliteBonus=n>=5?1.32:1,nx=-Math.sin(angle),ny=Math.cos(angle);for(let i=0;i<extra;i++){const side=i%2?1:-1,offset=side*(31+Math.floor(i/2)*19),x1=x+nx*offset,y1=y+ny*offset,x2=x1+Math.cos(angle)*length,y2=y1+Math.sin(angle)*length;applyRailBeam(x1,y1,x2,y2,width,damage,'#d9f3ff','rail-multiplicity',eliteBonus);}trimOldest(state.entities.beams,entityCap('beams'));};","fireRailgun=function multiplicityRailgun(n,echoed=false){const target=nearestWeaponTarget('rail'),x=player.x,y=player.y;baseFireRailgun(n,echoed);if(echoed||!target)return;const extra=multishotStacks(),targets=multiplicityTargets(target,extra,'rail'),length=weaponRange('rail'),size=weaponSizeMultiplier(),damage=(40+n*9.4)*.68,width=(5.2+n*.72)*size*.82,eliteBonus=n>=5?1.32:1;for(let i=0;i<extra;i++){const extraTarget=targets[i]||target,angle=Math.atan2(extraTarget.y-y,extraTarget.x-x),side=i%2?1:-1,nx=-Math.sin(angle),ny=Math.cos(angle),offset=extraTarget===target?side*(31+Math.floor(i/2)*19):side*8,x1=x+nx*offset,y1=y+ny*offset,x2=x1+Math.cos(angle)*length,y2=y1+Math.sin(angle)*length;applyRailBeam(x1,y1,x2,y2,width,damage,'#d9f3ff','rail-multiplicity',eliteBonus);}trimOldest(state.entities.beams,entityCap('beams'));};",'rail targets')
